 decision('local:catalog:organizational-design',['Q3318170'],'reuse_registered_id_central_decision','The proposal arranges responsibilities and coordination structures to achieve organizational purposes. Baseline Organizational architecture already denotes management of roles, processes and formal reporting relationships. The process-versus-entity comparison to Q43229 misses the semantically equivalent registered design subject.',['baseline-index concepts/Q3318170; selection.proposed.json proposal 126','https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/10-1-organizational-structures-and-design opening definitions'],['Use Q3318170 as an existing control. Preserve Organizational architecture as an alias and preserve baseline provenance. Do not keep the new local ID as an independently counted identity.']),
